## Third-party notices

The MIT licence above covers EverRoad's own source, assets and documentation.
It does not cover the following bundled third-party works, which are
redistributed under their own terms.

### Fonts — SIL Open Font License 1.1

EverRoad bundles two typefaces so that the game renders in its intended faces
without a network connection. Both are licensed under the SIL Open Font License
version 1.1, not MIT:

  * **Quicksand** — Copyright 2011 The Quicksand Project Authors
    (https://github.com/andrew-paglinawan/QuicksandFamily),
    with Reserved Font Name "Quicksand".
  * **JetBrains Mono** — Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
    (https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono).

The complete OFL 1.1 text for each is distributed with the fonts, in
`public/fonts/` in the source tree and `fonts/` in every packaged build:
`Quicksand-OFL.txt` and `JetBrainsMono-OFL.txt`.

Note the Reserved Font Name on Quicksand: a modified version of that font may
not be distributed under the name "Quicksand".
